  "description": "AbpAi.HttpApi: the model gateway's admin API over HTTP, under a route prefix the host sets. Site settings, connections (test, provider models, discovery), aliases, limits per scope and per account, which site models a scope may use, usage (queries, a person's own, recent calls, CSV) and exports of calls, over AbpAi's services and the host's rights. The host says who the actor is and what an action needing the password again means.",
